+//
+// A child agent JSON in a consuming repo specializes a base agent (e.g. the
+// generic wiki_publisher.json) instead of forking it:
+//
+//   {
+//     "parent": { "path": "../agents/wiki_publisher.json", "merge": ["params.cliPrompts"] },
